{
  "name": "Slayer's Prey",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can focus your ire on one foe, increasing the harm you inflict on it. Once per turn, you can designate one creature you can see as the target of this feature (no action required). The first time each turn that you hit that target with a weapon attack, it takes an extra 1d6 damage from the weapon. This damage increases to 2d6 when your reach 11th level in this class.</p>",
